  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758920,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10 Great Games II - Auf Wiedersehen Monty (Commodore 64)\n\nEmbark on a hilarious and chaotic quest in *Auf Wiedersehen Monty*, a side-scrolling action-comedy adventure for the Commodore 64. You play as Monty, a hapless British tourist who finds himself embroiled in a bizarre plot involving stolen sausages and a mischievous German count. \n\nThe gameplay blends platforming, puzzle-solving, and slapstick humor. Monty must navigate vibrant, cartoonish environments, dodging obstacles, battling quirky enemies (often with comical results), and collecting ingredients to create a special sausage that can defeat the Count. \n\nFeaturing charming pixel art and a catchy soundtrack, *Auf Wiedersehen Monty* offers a lighthearted and accessible gaming experience.  The game’s unique blend of British humor and German folklore creates a memorable and entertaining adventure. Expect plenty of silly antics, challenging jumps, and a surprisingly engaging storyline that will keep you laughing from start to finish. It's a perfect example of the C64's quirky and creative game development scene."
    },
